@startuml state
!include style.iuml
hide empty description

state "草稿" as Draft
state "已入账" as Posted
state "已撤回" as Withdrawn
state "已作废" as Voided #fbf0ee;line:a94a40;text:a94a40
state "已结算" as Settled #fbf0ee;line:a94a40;text:a94a40

[*] --> Draft : 新增／截图识别
Draft --> Posted : 提交（创建者）
Posted --> Withdrawn : 撤回（创建者）
Withdrawn --> Posted : 修改后重新提交（创建者）
Posted --> Voided : 作废（管理员／所有者）
Posted --> Settled : 纳入结算（REQ-014）
Voided --> [*]
Settled --> [*]

note left of Draft : 可修改、删除
note right of Posted : 创建者或管理员可修改，\n状态不变（REQ-007）
@enduml
